{"uid":"844dba03dba33dfc","name":"test_script_preserves_or_mints_run_id_so_the_docker_tag_is_never_shared","fullName":"tests.test_host_like_pytest_script#test_script_preserves_or_mints_run_id_so_the_docker_tag_is_never_shared","historyId":"258bf96891dc99281ac7d6b913c2fb54","time":{"start":1791937660941,"stop":1791937663302,"duration":2361},"description":"F1 (#73): scrubbing RALPHD_RUN_ID away collapses the docker tier's\n    per-run tag isolation (``ralphd:test-<RALPHD_RUN_ID>``, see\n    tests/test_docker_sibling_e2e.py) to the shared fallback\n    ``ralphd:test-local-dev`` that module falls back to when the variable is\n    absent -- exactly the collision the per-run tag exists to prevent. The\n    script must preserve an inherited RALPHD_RUN_ID unchanged, or mint a\n    fresh, unique one when none is inherited; either way the tag the docker\n    tier would build from it must never be the shared fallback, and two runs\n    with no inherited id must not mint the same one. A mutation of the\n    script back to unconditionally scrubbing RALPHD_RUN_ID makes this test\n    fail (the sentinel file stays empty).","descriptionHtml":"<p>F1 (#73): scrubbing RALPHD_RUN_ID away collapses the docker tier's<br />\nper-run tag isolation (<code>ralphd:test-&lt;RALPHD_RUN_ID&gt;</code>, see<br />\ntests/test_docker_sibling_e2e.py) to the shared fallback<br />\n<code>ralphd:test-local-dev</code> that module falls back to when the variable is<br />\nabsent -- exactly the collision the per-run tag exists to prevent. The<br />\nscript must preserve an inherited RALPHD_RUN_ID unchanged, or mint a<br />\nfresh, unique one when none is inherited; either way the tag the docker<br />\ntier would build from it must never be the shared fallback, and two runs<br />\nwith no inherited id must not mint the same one. A mutation of the<br />\nscript back to unconditionally scrubbing RALPHD_RUN_ID makes this test<br />\nfail (the sentinel file stays empty).</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"